%20Predator%20Scout\">Quara Predator Scout</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">400</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">890</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">190 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-129× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Double%20Axe\">Double Axe</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Scale%20Armor\">Scale Armor</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Quara Bone (uncommon)</li>\n<li>0-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Diamond\">Small Diamond</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Two%20Handed%20Sword\">Two Handed Sword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>0-5× <a href=\"#/wiki/Shrimp\">Shrimp</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fish%20Fin\">Fish Fin</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Northwind Rod (rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Quara%20Pincher%20Scout\"><img alt=\"Quara Pincher Scout\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Quara_Pincher_Scout_70fd50.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Quara%20Pincher%20Scout\">Quara Pincher Scout</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">600</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">775</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">240 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wik